{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>百萬YouTuber一隻阿圓日前發文提到自己結束了一段長久關係，16日她再次透過Instagram限時動態回應外界關心。她在文中寫下「我們各自都會加油」等語句，似乎也證實了與前《木曜4超玩》製作人陳百祥（本名李俊傑）已分手。</p><p>一隻阿圓16日透過限動回應外界所關注的感情狀態 ，她表示：</p><blockquote><p>謝謝大家關心！我跟對方都是很喜歡創作影片內容的人，更希望大家可以把注意力放在未來的作品上。</p></blockquote><p>同時她也提到「我們各自都會加油，繼續做好看的影片給觀眾，之後也不再多做回應」，顯然已回到了「各自的生活」。</p><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750682008644096000860125.jpeg/s3aasbbsq3QRHwS6PyT2kY5kvD6cGckmZqzUGmas1Bo\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476192877809664130845.jpeg/Q9p2RkqLsGIN5KeXooOFVFR3W9gSIRt06dSMj-nUjI8\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245109570473984638724.png/Kib0GGyusdP9NSsvdFpiRLtL58xbg6UJOgwnADoMJwA\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241212/943675761301131264386092.jpeg/KoImfGHy74QmGrobTXHi5bIGuWTe-45ooWUqVaFlKlU\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3435938/org/7ed422f61d03aaab520f09e094395d24.jpg/LSVcQtfYXdu5iFt57SROUU_xRu-P0_fvFb28_RW9vP0\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4092835/org/3b3a276bb10b23f5eda5b62f2e1fe868.jpg/L6SFeECFsjvPvcQX1IvYgrz7xmruDcFsn0uZIJ9LmSA\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4092833/org/93bb108e1f5ed8c40849625d89f06c2b.jpg/Mvt5c-5nx7gYqpQG2alPfqEXhcuAxS3cLivVDy4r1Q8\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476193020284928953278.jpeg/5ZJ3AK_2R2-JBB4ql1eEFmcGczHRcs7VQELc9UBC3PU\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476180999802880579268.jpeg/qmYI4JUq7sgjRreEoh4cWqx44aYksBMSbYjeJm2I3iY\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476203070361600927651.jpeg/wM2cr1VrLxWjHL-ddGwtNLNh5GAC_6ewzZNAqs2TQKo\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241212/943675992977838080243761.jpeg/mlhq-bf8XK5kMtjUq2gWA_eONZoqAVQQZDaNDWQ2jQ0\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476193028673536682413.jpeg/GVqYpdA_aQM1PPcH7QB8ro1CN72TwGHR7JV83uyVfN4\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221107/666298337108692992460579.jpeg/r3Hk8SCCb1Dts7JULED3DwAwZmsTVEUrYOeXcmDnl3I\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245104352497664879341.png/g-uy7hJrDy96Josnx8nSxxjajZWw_fNAHG0GhRxtBoU\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245009552576512052348.png/F8u9Ji75cgTdO2tC9PWAUATGjqUs7M3kZ9SYkWfUmJE\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240919/913476171138600960768391.jpeg/2cDq3Hu0p_YV1vAG6zkvIclVlDNfANrXHjrPhR46z4U\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221107/666298343547342848196034.jpeg/JB09He8vjUJSY0M7vp_v5bbucyOwTdkanEPIhpxDyIY\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245110837153792184603.png/d1hUKEn2q6ar48PkT63pq7rtyKx8rhx0Cl2Xhgpdl4Y\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245110438694912601534.png/Bz6ymDDIVQDWSw9_K6RlFV-gy4qmvU-cf0C_3H9Av9w\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250807/1030245103924547584413297.png/Nfm0-NKzSy0TldGgsGM3mveyAeFe37iPAXi2PQF4tj0\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3181768/org/5d59b27a6e5e9eb0a9173633765b00cf.jpg/DVZ7LWvBTRVu9gAIGRxuEztfd_nPyu_7anLFlGpyxZQ\"/><figcaption>一隻阿圓（IG@nanaciaociao）</figcaption></figure><p>一隻阿圓日前發文分享了滿樹楓紅的照片，並寫下：</p><blockquote><p>今年的我結束了一段非常長的關係，回到真的需要在意自己的日子，後來覺得很多事情並不是非黑即白。</p></blockquote><p>她當時提到自己想了很久，「也沒有人比我們更理解彼此很用心看待的歲月」，並認為只要雙方曾經用心對待過彼此，這樣其實就已經足夠，引起外界猜測她與認愛近2年的知名製作人陳百祥已分開。</p><figure><img alt=\"前《木曜4超玩》製作人陳百祥（IG@baisiang.c）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188084949996015616906135.jpeg/OjzduAzhLeXKw-RBYwtpsqY7gGS3awcfrVrn761a5-8\"/><figcaption>前《木曜4超玩》製作人陳百祥（IG@baisiang.c）</figcaption></figure><p>一隻阿圓與陳百祥是在2024年底被週刊拍到同框後公開認愛，交往期間兩人作風一直都很低調，很少公開放閃。如今透過最新限動表達各自加油，也算是說明了目前的感情現況。</p><p>一隻阿圓認愛「木曜4」陳百祥　網翻出一年前影片：早就一起拍片</p><p>一隻阿圓罕見放閃 大讚製作人男友百祥用心態度：他不會講所以我要講</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:39:02.002834+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1057,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:30:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:34.802245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:34.524984+00:00","content_hash":"5c216204b2112a55b7b714cd02a07198c8ebdbf9bc8755aa6ea4aea161655166","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}